{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":219822,"duration_api_ms":213225,"num_turns":16,"result":"Both tests pass with the DO and alkalinity assertions active and the DO sanity checks (non-zero delta) confirm they're not vacuously passing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Applied two amendments to the volume-independence regression tests in crates/tank_core/tests/cycling.rs: (1) Added DO (dissolved oxygen) and alkalinity per-liter delta assertions to both tests, closing the gap where a volume-dependent bug in the stoichiometric DO/alkalinity bookkeeping code paths (lines 230-235, 288-289, 332-334, 362-364 of nitrogen_cycle.rs) would not have been caught. (2) Added the full Monod factor verification section to the extreme-scale test (1L vs 1000L), which previously only checked per-liter deltas. Both tests now verify all seven species (TAN, NO2, NO3, DOC, DON, DO, alkalinity) for delta equality and five Monod factors for pre-tick equality. The third pending amendment (substrate area multiplier preservation) is out of scope for this test-only bead.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Read current state of cycling.rs and nitrogen_cycle.rs to understand the K_s field migration (legacy_total_param_to_mg_per_l removed, fields now native concentration units)\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Amendment 1: Added DO and alkalinity to the before() closure and delta assertions in concentration_kinetics_are_volume_independent, including a non-zero DO delta sanity check\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Amendment 1 (extreme): Added DO and alkalinity to the concs() closure and pairs array in concentration_kinetics_volume_independent_extreme_scales, including a non-zero DO delta sanity check\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Amendment 2: Added full Monod factor verification block (5 factors: TAN, NO2, DOC, DO-AOB, DO-decomp) to the extreme-scale test, matching the primary test's coverage\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Amendment 3 (substrate area multiplier preservation): Skipped — out of scope for this test-only bead (tanksim-6e5.2.3.5)\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"skipped\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran rustfmt, cargo clippy, and cargo test to validate: formatting clean, no clippy warnings, both amended tests pass, 17/18 cycling tests pass (1 pre-existing unrelated failure in aob_growth_reserves_tan)\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test cycling concentration_kinetics: 2 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo test --test cycling: 17 passed, 1 failed (pre-existing failure in aob_growth_reserves_tan_for_assimilation_when_tan_would_otherwise_hit_zero, unrelated to this bead)\",\n    \"cargo clippy --test cycling -- -W clippy::all: no warnings from cycling.rs\",\n    \"rustfmt --check crates/tank_core/tests/cycling.rs: no formatting issues\",\n    \"Primary test now asserts 7 per-liter deltas (TAN, NO2, NO3, DOC, DON, DO, alkalinity) plus 5 Monod factors\",\n    \"Extreme-scale test now asserts 7 per-liter deltas plus 5 Monod factors (previously only 5 deltas, no Monod factors)\",\n    \"Both tests include non-zero DO delta sanity checks confirming DO assertions are not vacuously passing\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Pending amendment 3 (substrate area multiplier preservation in resolved_colonizable_area_factor, refresh_habitat_registry, and migrate_v6_to_v7) was not applied — it is out of scope for this test-only bead and should be tracked as a separate task.\",\n    \"The pre-existing failure in aob_growth_reserves_tan_for_assimilation_when_tan_would_otherwise_hit_zero (line 400: residual TAN slightly above 1e-9 after K